e accepte de la suivre dans son couvent où trente Bénédictines vivent coupées du monde. Elle découvre que plusieurs d’entre elles, tombées enceintes dans des circonstances dramatiques, sont sur le point d’accoucher.  Peu à peu, se nouent entre Mathilde, athée et rationaliste, et les religieuses, attachées aux règles de leur vocation, des relations complexes que le danger va aiguiser...  C’est pourtant ensemble qu’elles retrouveront le chemin de la vie.","tagline":"Profondément émouvant et riche en émotions."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDlgrIQerzF6OU6hwHXstHCE2h3.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1lafNmLIrcWXHlASKmyo2sEAIOu.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":364051,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDlgrIQerzF6OU6hwHXstHCE2h3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mDlgrIQerzF6OU6hwHXstHCE2h3.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDlgrIQerzF6OU6hwHXstHCE2h3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mDlgrIQerzF6OU6hwHXstHCE2h3.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vOoYFgEPIz2eAwQ0Gfiz6bnszEb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vOoYFgEPIz2eAwQ0Gfiz6bnszEb.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZSPkyzq80jBVezRlC80kvV6QZr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8ZSPkyzq80jBVezRlC80kvV6QZr.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZSPkyzq80jBVezRlC80kvV6QZr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8Z